  <main id="main" class="page-shell"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About EPITHYIA GROUP</p><h1>Health information and<br><em>hospital access.</em></h1><p>EPITHYIA GROUP helps people in Uganda find hospital details, read practical health information, and submit appointment requests through a simple web directory.</p></section><section class="about-grid"><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h2>Find a facility</h2><p>Search Kampala hospitals and review their locations, telephone numbers, listed services, and operating information.</p></article><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h2>Request a visit</h2><p>Community members can request a preferred hospital date and time from their dashboard. Requests remain pending until an administrator reviews them; call the hospital to confirm availability.</p></article><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h2>Get urgent help</h2><p>Emergency contacts are shown as directory information only. Use local emergency services or a hospital's emergency unit for immediate danger.</p></article></section><p class="content-notice">The appointment workflow records a request but does not reserve a hospital slot, notify hospital staff, provide emergency response, diagnose, or give individualized medical advice.</p></main>
